// An array as a value, signals: sig combine. KIELER rejects it: assignment to ‘int’ from ‘int *’ makes integer from
// pointer without a cast [-Wint-conversion].
scchart Main { int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] signal int S combine + output int x initial state A do S(a) go to B state B if S do x = val(S) go to A }
